commit 72e7424e79f8b539e582b7217596e27d78057c28
Author: sergiogportela <sergiogp@bu.edu>
Date:   Mon May 18 18:01:57 2026 -0300

    Fix DnD @path: wrap CM6 extension in Prec.highest
    
    Obsidian's MarkdownView registers its own CM6 drop handler that returns
    true, which preempted ours in the domEventHandlers chain — drag-and-drop
    from the file explorer inserted a wikilink instead of an @path. Wrapping
    buildDragDropExtension in Prec.highest puts ours first.
    
    Also drop the stray document-level "drop" capture listener that wiped
    _currentDragRefs before our handler could read it.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
